      "comment": "Rotwang: Avrelian and the Sampo Mill",
      "content": "Rotwang found the outlaw Avrelian, who had taken the name Reed Miller, and convinced him they were both chosen by fate to build an Elysium. He led him to take the Sampo Mill, a lost Hyperborean relic, and used the promise of an Elysium for the forgotten as a lure. Avrelian was executed without meeting the Tsar; Alia says Avrelian never wanted the future Rotwang described.",
