        "Rauthvangi"
      ],
      "comment": "Rotwang: Pillar of Embla",
      "content": "With the Sampo Mill he raised a tower toward the False Sky and meant to siphon the land's energy to ascend into his \"Elysium\". Alia's sacrifice stopped it. In 6.3 the Pillar fell to the Abyss again and the Cataclysm Egg grew atop it.\n\nThe Arrow of Terpikeraunas was built tall enough to reach its top.",
