    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Kipumaki Cliff",
        "undying serpent",
        "undying fiend"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Rotwang",
        "Professor",
        "Rauthvangi"
      ],
      "comment": "Rotwang: Kipumaki Cliff Seal",
      "content": "After his first death he rose again and was sealed beneath Kipumaki Cliff by Solovei and Aila. Aila foretold: \"Twice shall that undying serpent rise again, but thrice shall he be struck down... And at last shall he be laid to rest by the heroes of the sublunary sphere.\" The Silver Lampwick and Spiralblade were retrieved to arm the Arrow against his third rising.",
