      "key": [
        "Arrow of Terpikeraunas",
        "Terpikeraunas"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Rotwang",
        "Professor",
        "Rauthvangi",
        "Piramida"
      ],
      "comment": "Rotwang: Arrow of Terpikeraunas",
      "content": "A bow-and-arrow mechanism that, per Nikita, the Torchforger (Solovei) and the first Moonchanter (Aila) forged with ancient craft for the day the fiend would be ended, passed down through the Lightkeepers and housed in Piramida's Great Mead Hall. With the Spiralblade set as its arrowhead, Illuga and the Traveler fired it and destroyed the Cataclysm Egg, ending him.",
