        "Professor",
        "Rauthvangi"
      ],
      "comment": "Rotwang: Morozov and Raimo",
      "content": "His followers in the Cataclysm. Morozov ran an 'apocalypse' bunker, deceived its people about the outside world and meant them to die so Rotwang's plan could proceed; after Brahe's arrival exposed the lie, the researcher Grazina turned on him and sealed him in the bunker. Raimo became an Abyss monster and was sealed in Dreadshade Mire as the Serpent of All Evils. Both returned corrupted in the final battle.",
